---
// FAQ Section
---

<section id="faq" class="faq section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Is Followbirds only for Algarve?</h3>
        <p>
          Followbirds is starting in Algarve, Portugal. The goal is to become excellent locally before expanding to other regions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Can guides use it for tours?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes. Followbirds is designed around guide workflows: tour templates, shared observations, live checklists and automatic reports.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Does it work offline?</h3>
        <p>
          The app is offline-first. Bird and location content remains useful even without connection.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Are reports automatic?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes. Reports are generated automatically from tour observations, species lists, photos and notes after each tour.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How can I join the Guide Program?</h3>
        <p>
          Email guides@followbirds.com to join the early guide program. Early guides get featured and priority support.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .faq h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #111815;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .faq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    padding: 2rem;
    background: #F4EFF6;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #E8DFD3;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .faq-item:hover {
    border-color: #559858;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(47, 125, 50, 0.1);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    color: #111815;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    color: #727272;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .faq {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .faq h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
